s-builders/the-cheapest-cuda-gpu-on-aws-has-an-arm-cpu-and-you-probably-want-the-intel-one-325b\",\"Gemma 4 E2B on the two cheapest whole-GPU CUDA instances AWS sells. Same Turing GPU, different host CPU. One is cheaper per hour, the other is cheaper per token, and the reason is not the CPU.\",\"2026-08-31T01:40:08.000Z\",[\"aws\",\"cuda\",\"machinelearning\",\"vllm\"]]]}}]}"}}}
